iii. Personal Learning Goals

As a Computer Engineering student, I want to develop a better understanding of how Software Engineering and Artificial Intelligence can work 
together in creating intelligent and useful applications. My personal learning goals for this course are:

1. Strengthen my understanding of software engineering principles and how artificial intelligence can be integrated into software development.
2. Become familiar with different AI tools, technologies, and frameworks that can assist in developing intelligent software applications.
3. Understand how AI agents work, how they make decisions, and how they can perform tasks with minimal human intervention.
4. Gain hands-on experience in designing, developing, testing, and improving software applications with the help of AI technologies.
5. Learn how to apply proper software development processes, including planning, designing, coding, testing, and maintaining software systems.
6. Learn how to use AI as a development tool to approach technical challenges and create solutions to real-world problems.
